<p>Alweda alweda aye hussain alweda<br />
Ham se haqqe aza na ada hosaka</p>

<p>1. Ham shabhi e nabi ali akbare jawaa&rsquo;n<br />
Barchi ki nok se qalb tera chida<br />
Tera lasha na utha &ndash; ali akbar alweda</p>

<p>2. Hain roohe qudsi par magar sarfe aza<br />
Har ghadi maa ne bas shah ka matam hai kiya<br />
Bolo sar peetkar- nonehaalo alweda</p>

<p>3. Haaye shabbar ke laal haye haidar ke Jamaal<br />
Tera laasha ran mei ho chuka hai pamaal<br />
Aye farwa ke chand- haaye qasim alweda</p>

<p>4. Aye mere bawafa tujhpa hum sab ka salaam<br />
Tera parcham liye ayenge jab imam<br />
Hoga parcham tale &ndash; tera matam alweda</p>

<p>5. Asghare bezabaa&rsquo;n chid gaya tera gala<br />
Haaye aada ne par tujhko paani na diya<br />
Haaye cheh maah ke sheerkhwaar alweda</p>

<p>6. Haaye shahzadiyo tumne kya kya na saha<br />
Chin gayin sar se rida hogayi&rsquo;n beparda<br />
Dee&rsquo;n bachaya tumne- bibiyo sad alweda</p>

<p>7. Thaame pehlu bibi aati&rsquo;n thi&rsquo;n har ghar me<br />
Apne shabbier ka ham se pursa lene<br />
Ab wo rounaq na rahi jaati&rsquo;n hain syeda</p>

<p>8. Hamse haqqe aza na ada hosaka<br />
Aur jee bhar ke bhi tera matam na hua<br />
Aye qateelul abara aye shaeede karbala</p>

<p>9. Mirza aur meer ki bas yahi hai ilteja<br />
Tera matam kare hashr tak ahle aza<br />
Kehti hain asghari aye hussain alweda</p>

<p>
<center><h4>Kalaam : Mirza Aur Kumai</h4></center></p>
